  ],
  "final_files": {
    "numbers.py": "def total(values):\n    return sum(value for value in values if value is not None)\n",
    "labels.py": "def normalize(value):\n    return value.strip().lower()\n",
    "README.md": "# Helpers\n\nUtilities for small helper functions.\n\n## `numbers.total`\n\n`numbers.total(values)` 返回一个可迭代对象 `values` 中所有数字的和：\n\n- 忽略值为 `None` 的元素；\n- 保留 0 和负数；\n- 为空可迭代对象时返回 `0`。\n\n示例：\n\n```python\nfrom numbers import total\n\n# 空输入\ntotal([])  # 0\n\n# 普通求和\ntotal([1, 2, 3])  # 6\n\n# 保留 0 和负数\ntotal([0, -1, 2])  # 1\n\n# 忽略 None\ntotal([None, 1, None, 2])  # 3\n```\n\n## `labels.normalize`\n\n`labels.normalize(value)` 用于规范化字符串：\n\n- 去除首尾空白字符（空格、制表符、换行等）；\n- 将所有字母转换为小写；\n- 保留中间的空格和其他字符不变。\n\n示例：\n\n```python\nfrom labels import normalize\n\n# 去除首尾空白并转小写\nnormalize(\"  Hello  \")  # \"hello\"\n\n# 保留中间空格\nnormalize(\" Foo  Bar \")  # \"foo  bar\"\n\n# 处理各种首尾空白\nnormalize(\"\\tMixed CASE \\n\")  # \"mixed case\"\n```\n",
    "test_numbers.py": "import unittest\nfrom numbers import total\n\nclass NumbersTest(unittest.TestCase):\n    def test_total(self):\n        self.assertEqual(total([2, None, -1, 0]), 1)\n    def test_empty(self):\n        self.assertEqual(total([None]), 0)\n",
    "test_labels.py": "import unittest\nfrom labels import normalize\n\nclass LabelsTest(unittest.TestCase):\n    def test_normalize(self):\n        self.assertEqual(normalize(' A B '), 'a b')\n    def test_empty(self):\n        self.assertEqual(normalize('  '), '')\n"
  },
